flowchart LR
  M[master dir] --> U1[unit A] & U2[unit B]
  U1 --> W[walk media files<br/>skip _flat, newShrinkedFiles, symlinks]
  W --> I{inode already<br/>in _flat?}
  I -- yes --> OK[ok]
  I -- no --> N[FlatNamer: level 0..3<br/>within statvfs name limit]
  N --> P[(plan TSV)]
  P --> C{confirm}
  C -- yes --> L[os.link into unit/_flat<br/>update _index.tsv]
